      "value": "Because this was not mentioned in the patch notes I submitted this as a bug. Either way, I'd appreciate if this was looked into, as I heavily rely on the behaviour that was present before the OSC patch.\nOh, and apologies for the typo in the title. I'd edit it if I could! 😁",
